Package: paperweight-fonts
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: PaperweightOS Nerd Fonts — JetBrains Mono and Symbols
 Ships JetBrains Mono Nerd Font (Regular, Bold, Italic, BoldItalic, Medium,
 SemiBold, and Mono variants) and the Nerd Fonts Symbols-Only font, providing
 full Nerd Font glyph coverage for terminals, waybar, and editors.
 .
 Fonts are sourced from https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts and licensed
 under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
